DESCRIPTION >
    Versioned current-state projection of ActiveCampaign contacts. ReplacingMergeTree
    keeps point-in-time reads fast while preserving late Fivetran corrections.

SCHEMA >
    `contact_id` Int64 `json:$.contact_id`,
    `email` Nullable(String) `json:$.email`,
    `phone` Nullable(String) `json:$.phone`,
    `first_name` Nullable(String) `json:$.first_name`,
    `last_name` Nullable(String) `json:$.last_name`,
    `contact_created_at` Nullable(DateTime64(6)) `json:$.contact_created_at`,
    `source_version` DateTime64(6) `json:$.source_version`,
    `is_deleted` UInt8 `json:$.is_deleted`

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY contact_id
ENGINE_VER source_version
